OL,3,AGerman neo-Nazi suspected of deadly
OL,4,A1970 fire at Jewish retirement home
OL,5,
OL,6,FGerman investigators believe they have
OL,7,Fnow identified an arsonist who set fire
OL,8,Fto a Jewish community centre in Munich
OL,9,Fin 1970, killing seven people.
OL,11,FFor decades the man's identity remained
OL,12,Fa mystery. But Munich prosecutors now
OL,13,Fbelieve he was a 25-year-old lone
OL,14,Fneo-Nazi with known antisemitic
OL,15,Fopinions.
OL,17,FThe seven killed were all Holocaust
OL,18,Fsurvivors aged 59 to 71. Another 15
OL,19,Fpeople were injured.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
