OL,3,AGerman neo-Nazi suspected of deadly
OL,4,A1970 fire at Jewish retirement home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prosecutors' revelations come too
OL,7,Flate to secure justice for the victims.
OL,8,FThe suspect, identified by Der Spiegel
OL,9,Fmagazine as Bernd V, died in 2020.
